{"id": "34344", "title": "都是好奇惹的祸", "author": "宝贝", "category": "文学名著", "count": 39, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34344.htm", "intro": "不可以偷窥别人，这事人人都知道，但好奇的因子战胜了理性，让人忍不住想要偷看那么一眼、两眼、三眼……这一看不得了！原来这个善良的笨蛋丑秘书那么漂亮，不仅有「内在美」也有「外在美」，所以啰～～他不择手段留下她不是他的错，都是好奇惹的祸！就算被未婚妻背叛、被敌人整到差点破产，只要有他这个商界奇才加上爱管闲事的笨秘书，他们这对宇宙无敌的超级组合一定能把公司夺回来！", "base": "files/article/html/34/34344", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2182335.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2182336.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2182337.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2182338.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2182339.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2182340.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2182341.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2182342.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2182343.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2182344.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2182345.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2182346.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2182347.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2182348.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2182349.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2182350.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2182351.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2182352.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2182353.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2182354.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2182355.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2182356.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2182357.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2182358.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2182359.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第26